; EpoCanva P3.6 -- exports of the hosted TEST DLL variant.
;
; This is NOT the product DLL and not a registration mechanism. The two COM entry points are
; the same ones the product DLL exports. The EpoCanvaTest* names are the private lifecycle
; seam: fixed C/POD parameters only, no callbacks, no internal object access, no STL.
; DllRegisterServer/DllUnregisterServer remain absent.
EXPORTS
    DllCanUnloadNow                     PRIVATE
    DllGetClassObject                   PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetEngineConfig         PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestClearEngineConfig       PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestGetDiagnostics          PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetStartGate            PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetStopGate             PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetCleanupGate          PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestSetForceCleanupFailure  PRIVATE
    EpoCanvaTestLeaseDoubleRelease      PRIVATE
